# Rockstar Games Launcher. Fixes from frankea/Whisky's LauncherPresets.swift and SteamLauncher.swift
# (GPL-3.0-or-later): the launcher and Social Club draw with Chromium and need DXVK; Launcher.exe's
# D3D12 query hangs its exit, which leaves the game "running" in Steam, so d3d12 is off for both,
# with NVIDIA's libraries as for Steam's helpers. Rockstar titles bought on Steam start this
# launcher inside the Steam bottle; the app applies these lines there too.
name Rockstar Games Launcher
kind launcher
status experimental
symbol r.circle
about Лаунчер Rockstar (GTA, Red Dead). Интерфейс через DXVK. Ещё не проверен на нашем движке.
bottle rockstar
installer https://gamedownloads.rockstargames.com/public/installer/Rockstar-Games-Launcher.exe
exe C:\Program Files\Rockstar Games\Launcher\Launcher.exe
env WINE_LARGE_ADDRESS_AWARE=1
env LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8
env CEF_DISABLE_SANDBOX=1
dxvk Launcher.exe
dxvk SocialClubHelper.exe
dll Launcher.exe d3d12=,nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
dll SocialClubHelper.exe d3d12=,nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
